Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Such pretty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've pretty eyes\Nand a smile to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lookin' to score riches?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I welcome all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya know the first rule in combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...to get the first attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What an extended greeting this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that the sure-shot\Nand master of poker,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the legendary female gambler\NPoker Alice was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If she was still alive,\Nshe'd be 219 years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. You sure don't look over 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Alice never lost during her lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.21,0:03:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept winning, without cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a way to prove that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you are carrying a large debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Which do you prefer...\Nthe police, or my establishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlie said,\N"Only hands can wash hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to receive,\Nyou must first give."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't that mean that\NCharlie is telling us to just do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Charlie Parker\Nwould quote Goethe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, it's all part of the dream I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The way things go,\NI say that even the hard-earned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,5000 woolongs will\Ndisappear with your dream. {linked to the next line to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something, Spike...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a no smoking area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't play.\NYour eyes are too good for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll kick us out if you win too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't bring me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pray, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that. {original: "I'll take one." Alt: "I'll take these"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Small jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Must be him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Jackie. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The target will sit at a blackjack table,\Nand lose at a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you will help him with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And, he will hand you the last\Nchip he has as a dealer's chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something that'll make your debt as small as one tiny second in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Last game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lucky, nor am I nimble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are you? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya got me. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this as a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of you is generous?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't the plan I heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were supposed\Nto give me the last chip!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I played along with you and your cheats!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Did ya hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The dealer has been cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you come with me to the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this casino also run a fitness club?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh heh. Pardon me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:10:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you not to—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it! But we gotta split!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't cashed these in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have it. The chip is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither you nor your boss realize\Nwhy we cooked up this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If that chip falls into police hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, we still can't find that broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a reward on her if you have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my reward for bringing\Nya back being trapped in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. She smells like\Nmoney to you too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet, how much did you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, 200K. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And who put it all to naught?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What, only 200K?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nothing compared to my debt...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, don't you think this is\Na bit much for a false accusation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that mono-carrier\Nshould sell for about 400K.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had just given me that chip,\Nwe wouldn't have had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you give that to Gordon,\Nhe'll give you as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know any guy named Gordon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,nor do I want to believe your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it's a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean that kind of chip.\NThere's a microchip in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amigo! Leave it to us{\i0}\N{\i1}for bounty information!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for waiting! It's time for Big Shot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:10.42,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, first up this week is...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.83,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a shame we have to\Nhand her to the police.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:16.16,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't look it, but she's\Na real mean one. Faye Valentine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.68,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bounty is a whopping{\i0}\N{\i1}6 million! A real deal!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:21.48,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First come, first served.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.59,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck, cowboys!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First off, let me tell you{\i0}\N{\i1}that I didn't intend to run.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An old fishing ship in the gate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They have the chip.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So hurry up and—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we thought we were being immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To leave a young woman\Nin a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't thinking\Nweird thoughts, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we thought we'd escort you to\Na place more considerate of your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and where would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The police.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry that we were so cheap\Nearlier with the 200K bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What, there's a bounty on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A whopping 6 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What... only 6 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How much {\i1}are{\i0} you in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!\NAnywhere but the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the police would give us money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother's last will was for me to\Nnot be in any place for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My family have always been "Romanies,"\Nwandering about in search of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?\NThat's another term for Gypsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, like you guys, with no\Npride in their lives are called "Gorgio."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with being a "Gorgio."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's calling me... The great\Noutdoors is calling out to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it for the police. {original: "You can do all of this with the cops."}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:16:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. I won't run.\NAt least untie one hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even go to\Nthe bathroom like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, we got one yappy woman here... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Like taking candy from a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,More like a small sacrifice for a large reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As Charlie said, "If you want\Nto receive, you must first give."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess what I see in dreams is\Nworth something once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know who you are,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I would like the chip back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know who you are,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I refuse.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a chip that means nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Although we can sell what's{\i0}\N{\i0}in{\i1} the chip for a pretty penny.{\i0} {"in" was capitalized}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a decryption program\Ncalled Crypt-Breaker
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that was developed by SIT three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumors say that right after its completion,\Nthe programmer was killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and the program went into the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a "magic key" that can decode and{\i0}\N{\i1}unlock almost every protection code.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that program itself was encoded.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there was a need to find\Nthe key to open the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard rumors that both the cops and\Nthe ISSP were parting hairs to find the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would see\Nit in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to work in a shady\Nplace called the ISSP.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure the casino was to{\i0}\N{\i1}take attention away from{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the large sum of money{\i0}\N{\i1}and to fool the cops...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You just chose the wrong day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, this thing is useless for us as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would only be proper to give it to the cops.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:18:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}300 million... Nah, too much.{\i0}\N{\i1}How about 30 million?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not bad for the price of a magic key, eh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, 6 million turns into 30 million.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The money just keeps growing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't get caught off-guard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okey dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who specifies cash\Nup front is rare nowadays. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.55,0:19:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an old-fashioned guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both count to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At which point, we'll release\Nthe magnetic field of the suitcase {original: "we will"}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and send it that way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You toss the chip our way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trusting you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When you confirm that we got\Nthe chip, sink that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.23,0:19:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutters are meant to be opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, "Gorgio."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, "Romani."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye! {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet, let's get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them! Get them!\NWhat the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She dropped chaff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Missiles are approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That wench...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only proper to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we have to build up\Nagain from square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
