Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It sucks... this world is such an unruly place. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Economic recession everywhere,\Nmaking kids lose their minds...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.31,0:24:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this isn't the time\Nto be reading the paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aboard the Bebop are\Nbecoming even more unruly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.45,0:24:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bah, this is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this... terrorists! Apparently\Nthey want to blow Ganymede up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Environmental Protection Society?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect! We can have them\Ntake care of this fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.74,0:24:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Gateway Shuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, {\i1}I'm{\i0} about to lose it.
